      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_52",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("All is quiet. Whatever fight was happening here, it ended before we could intervene."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 37,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_53",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_54",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "familiar",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Curious. The wrecks are not of proper ships, but of shallow-draft rafts built only recently; much of their timber is green. Those that were not capsized have been burned. And most curious of all — all flew the banner of Wesnoth."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            portrait: "portraits/lisar-glad.webp",
            text: _("Wesnoth! There is only one army of Wesnoth in these lands, and it is the one which I led here to fight you. These must be survivors from the volcano!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I’m afraid they don’t seem to be survivors any longer, Li’sar."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "drake-hit-2.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Keh_Ohn",
            type: "Armageddon Drake",
            side: 2,
            x: 27,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Keh_Ohn",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Keh%20Ohn%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Keh Ohn",
            object: "%7B%22id%22%3A%22%22%2C%22effects%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22abilities%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Keh Ohn",
            x: 5,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Keh Ohn",
            text: _("Interlopers from the Domain of Men! Heed this warning for it is the last I shall offer your kind — Seek no further trespass of our land across this river. Lest you reach only that same end as they who did so before you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("A drake! So the winged figures we saw fighting were drakes. You are the ones who destroyed this flotilla?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Keh Ohn",
            text: _("We are. For in violation of our Ways, they harvested game from our Domain. Then... they took the eggs of drakes... our eggs... as prey. For such an act, I should grant no leniency. Yet long ago, my ancestors once made similar transgressions against your kind. So I grant you, who were not directly responsible, your lives. Now go."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("The soldiers consumed drake eggs? I cannot imagine anyone would be fool enough to do such a thing, unless unknowingly or in extreme starvation. I fear this has been a terrible misunderstanding."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            text: _("The men I trained are skilled and tenacious. If it was possible to survive, they will have. We will go, drake, but you will first turn over any prisoners and allow us to search the river for survivors."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Keh Ohn",
            text: _("Their lives are forfeit. All who have preyed upon our young, we shall destroy. The matter is decided. My decision, final."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            portrait: "portraits/lisar-mad.webp",
            text: _("Foul dragon, the decision was never yours to make! If but one soldier of Wesnoth has survived then I am coming to his rescue. Stand in my way only if you seek to do battle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Keh Ohn",
            text: _("So be it, fellow contender."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Keh Ohn",
            x: 27,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Keh Ohn",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_55",
        on: "side_turn_end",
        once: true,
